Description: PineStem billed hours against the weekly target, on the panel
 Shows your PineStem billed hours for the week against your target and the
 loss-of-pay line: GNOME Shell panel extension, tray icon on other desktops,
 mini widget and dashboard. Includes the paced background service.
 .
 Removing the package never deletes files in a home directory; use
 "Remove my Pace data" in Preferences first for a clean slate.
